  "releaseNotes": "1.1.2: Verified republish of the 1.1.1 multi-page DirectContent fix. The library surface is unchanged from 1.1.1; this release adds an in-library reproduction sample (S11_OrdersStyleReport) and PdfPig-based rendering-visibility regression tests that confirm the fix against a landscape multi-page report pattern with a title drawn into the reportHeader band before the first NewPage() call. Use 1.1.2 in preference to 1.1.1. No API changes. See CHANGELOG.md for details.",
